  "id": "behind-the-scenes-s01e17-scene-17",
  "pair": "zh-en",
  "title": "篡改记录替他顶罪  (Altering the Log to Take the Blame)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "bu_xiaogu": "布小谷",
    "chun_yuqiao": "淳于乔"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Just as executives confront Chun Yuqiao over the missing master tape, Bu Xiaogu bursts into the room claiming she deleted the footage herself. Listen to their dramatic Mandarin exchange.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "是我干的！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "魅力远航的成片，其实是我删的。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "电脑记录显示，删片的时间是昨天夜里的两点二十二分。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "淳于总刷卡进门的时间是一点半。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "之后我刷卡进门的时间是两点整。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我有系统记录的证据，而且我已经报警了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "根本不是她干的。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "这会儿警察已经到公司了，我现在就去自首。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "要么不做，要么一块做，你想跟我一块发疯是吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "你以为这是小孩过家家呢？真是太幼稚了！",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "是我干的！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I was the one who did it!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "魅力远航的成片，其实是我删的。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I was actually the one who deleted the master cut of the travel show.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "电脑记录显示，删片的时间是昨天夜里的两点二十二分。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Computer logs show the deletion happened at twenty-two past two last night.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "淳于总刷卡进门的时间是一点半。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Chun Yuqiao swiped his badge to enter at half past one.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "之后我刷卡进门的时间是两点整。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Afterward, I swiped my badge to enter at two o'clock.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我有系统记录的证据，而且我已经报警了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I have proof from the system log, and I have already called the police.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "根本不是她干的。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'She did not do this at all.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "这会儿警察已经到公司了，我现在就去自首。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'The police have arrived downstairs right now, and I am going to turn myself in.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "要么不做，要么一块做，你想跟我一块发疯是吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Either stay out of it or go crazy together—are you trying to lose your mind alongside me?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "你以为这是小孩过家家呢？真是太幼稚了！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Do you think this is children playing house? How utterly childish!'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "是我干的！",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "魅力远航的成片，其实是我删的。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "电脑记录显示，删片的时间是昨天夜里的两点二十二分。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "淳于总刷卡进门的时间是一点半。",
      "gap": 0.5
