    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "之后我刷卡进门的时间是两点整。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我有系统记录的证据，而且我已经报警了。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "根本不是她干的。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "这会儿警察已经到公司了，我现在就去自首。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "要么不做，要么一块做，你想跟我一块发疯是吗？",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "你以为这是小孩过家家呢？真是太幼稚了！",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Chun Yuqiao immediately sees through Bu Xiaogu's fabricated timestamps and pulls her aside to scold her reckless attempt to share his punishment. See you next time!",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "再见！",
      "gap": 0.3
    }
  ],
